# Icon Guidelines
- All icons live strictly in `src/components/icons/icons.tsx`.
- Never import from `lucide-react`, `react-icons`, `@heroicons/*`, or other icon packages.
- Always use `<Icon name="..." size={16 | 20 | 24} />`.
- See `docs/ai/icons.md`.
